# Equation sources for capacitor.md — rendered into capacitor.assets/eq-*.svg

name: energy
tex: E = \tfrac{1}{2}\,C\,V_C^2
---
name: charge
tex: Q = C\,V_C
---
name: differentiate
tex: \frac{d}{dt}\big[Q(t)\big] = \frac{d}{dt}\big[C\,V_C(t)\big] \quad\Longrightarrow\quad \frac{dQ}{dt} = C\,\frac{dV_C}{dt}
---
name: current-def
tex: I = \frac{dQ}{dt}
---
name: law
tex: \boxed{\,I_C(t) = C\,\frac{dV_C}{dt}\,}
---
name: units-farad
tex: 1\ \text{F} = \frac{1\ \text{C}}{1\ \text{V}} = \frac{\text{A}\cdot\text{s}}{\text{V}}
---
name: units-check
tex: \left(\frac{\text{A}\cdot\text{s}}{\text{V}}\right)\times\left(\frac{\text{V}}{\text{s}}\right) = \text{A}
---
name: ramp
tex: V_C(t) - V_C(0) = \frac{I_C}{C}\,t
